      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Wheel and Zoom Test Bench\n\nA bench for the gesture contract in the idea [The Camera Behaves Like the Browser](github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/zoom-and-wheel-behavior/root.node).\n\nEach fixture below is a surface the wheel has to decide about. The **Check Script** runs every case and prints what happened next to what the contract says should happen. **Cases** is the contract, one row per case.\n\nUse **Enter test bench** to go to the fixtures."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "wheel-test-bench"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1787849375818,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
    {
