      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "wheel-test-bench"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Paragraph 1. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 2. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 3. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 4. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 5. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 6. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 7. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 8. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 9. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 10. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 11. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 12. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 13. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 14. A long document is the plainest thing a wheel can scroll: it has one scroll region, and nothing else on it needs the wheel.\n\nParagraph 15. A